OL,3,GNEWSAPregnancy scan could have saved
OL,4,Ababy, says coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has said they are concerned a
OL,7,Fpregnancy assessment that could have
OL,8,Fsaved a baby's life is not a mandatory
OL,9,Frequirement.
OL,11,FJesse Parsons died aged three days at
OL,12,FSt Peter's Hospital in Chertsey,
OL,13,FSurrey, after his brain did not receive
OL,14,Fenough blood flow around his time of
OL,15,Fbirth in July 2025.
OL,17,FSurrey coroner Dr Karen Henderson said
OL,18,Fthis was because of the rare pregnancy
OL,19,Fcomplication vasa praevia, which is
OL,20,Fchecked for at 20 weeks gestation in
OL,21,Fother countries.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
